{
  "total_ms": 60240,
  "total_chars": 245,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "儿子当着您的面管孩子，您心疼，一伸手把孙子拉到身后——这一拉，坏的是规矩。",
      "chars": 37,
      "speech_ms": 8320,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 8320,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "从那天起，孩子就学精了：一挨说，就往爷爷奶奶身后躲；往后遇上事，先找老人挡着。",
      "chars": 39,
      "speech_ms": 9380,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 8720,
      "end_ms": 18100,
      "trace_id": "0748751f54323fc54dd5b6e7069047b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "我给您三条，记好了。",
      "chars": 10,
      "speech_ms": 1830,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 18500,
      "end_ms": 20330,
      "trace_id": "07487525376fe410aec74136f935f480"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第一，不插嘴：儿女开口管，您把话咽回去。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 5100,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 20730,
      "end_ms": 25830,
      "trace_id": "0748752c6b88fbd4dee13bf633ddc334"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第二，不拉人：普通管教，别当着面把孩子抢过来；真要是动手伤着孩子，那是另一回事，得拦。",
      "chars": 43,
      "speech_ms": 10000,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 26230,
      "end_ms": 36230,
      "trace_id": "07487532d1e74a02f7b793404f9dda4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "第三，不翻旧账：别说「你小时候我也没这么管过你」。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 5990,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 36630,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "trace_id": "074875380c8de5c6eae64daa5c43f399"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "有意见怎么办？",
      "chars": 7,
      "speech_ms": 910,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 43020,
      "end_ms": 43930,
      "trace_id": "0748753f9fc54a0da3296853fca48489"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "留一条：回屋，关门，跟儿女慢慢商量。",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 5230,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 44330,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "trace_id": "07487545836217063357603c36386808"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "咱老人的位置，是在儿女身后撑着，不是站到前头抢方向盘。",
      "chars": 27,
      "speech_ms": 5870,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 49960,
      "end_ms": 55830,
      "trace_id": "0748754cff9d104ce396d37e39a7a645"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "撑得住，一家人的规矩才说得到一块儿去。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 3620,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 56230,
      "end_ms": 59850,
      "trace_id": "0748755232d44fa31359b0d0177e19cd"
    }
  ]
}